sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Manager
  participant W as PHP web app
  participant DB as MySQL
  participant S as Python ML service
  participant M as Trained model
  U->>W: choose kitchen, meal, week, price, promotion (POST + CSRF token)
  W->>W: check session, role and CSRF token, validate inputs
  W->>DB: SELECT last 4 weeks of orders (prepared statement)
  DB-->>W: history rows
  W->>S: POST /predict (JSON: inputs, kitchen and meal details, history)
  S->>S: validate JSON, build features (lags, price ratio, seasonality)
  S->>M: predict(features)
  M-->>S: predicted demand
  S->>S: multiply by safety factors (50 to 95 percent levels)
  S-->>W: JSON (forecast, recommended preparation, reliability)
  W->>DB: INSERT prediction (audit trail)
  W-->>U: result page: forecast, recommendation, chart
